 the lines of fear and blame\nYou begin to wonder why you came\n\nWhere did I go wrong? I lost a friend\nSomewhere along in the bitterness\nAnd I would have stayed up with you all night\nHad I known how to save a life\n\n#TheFray #HowToSaveALife #PopRock", "channel_id": "UC61baUoIGkDzh_gWGRpnIcA", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC61baUoIGkDzh_gWGRpnIcA", "duration": 267, "view_count": 360047821, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cjVQ36NhbMk", "categories": ["Music"], "tags": ["how to save life", "where did go wrong", "the fray", "the fray how to save life", "where did go wrong lost friend", "save life", "fray how to save life", "fray", "how to save life the fray", "lost friend", "how to save life grey's anatomy", "grey's anatomy soundtrack", "2000s alternative", "alternative rock", "the fray you found me", "the millennial mixtape", "2000s rock", "tiktok trend", "tiktok song", "tiktok", "the fray tiktok", "how to save life tiktok", "Adult Alternative"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {"en": [{"url": "https://manifest.googlevideo.com/api/manifest/hls_timedtext_playlist/expire/1788337606/ei/ZomXasT4HtWGobIPupLeyQ4/ip/18.229.136.40/id/723550dfa3616cc9/source/youtube/requiressl/yes/dur/266.766/tts_params/caps%3Dasr%26v%3DcjVQ36NhbMk%26lang%3Den%26name%3Den%26ip%3D18.229.136.40%26ipbits%3D0%26expire%3D1788337606%26sparams%3Dip,ipbits,expire,caps,v%26signature%3D62B0AFF0C4479C568009E03EB83400AEF3856FCE.97374D1C1AADC9F386563DB429B4D8209D14975C%26key%3Ddg_yt0/rqh/4/hls_chunk_host/rr1---sn-bg0e6n7d.googlevideo.com/xpc/EgVo2aDSNQ%3D%3D/cps/763/met/1788316006,/mh/Rp/mm/18,26/mn/sn-bg0e6n7d,sn-hp57ynss/ms/aub,onr/mv/m/mvi/1/pl/17/rms/aub,aub/gcr/br/initcwndbps/2455000/siu/1/bui/AR3QkAmLl4Uq6GLXghmSW6P5e-WEcBwcFfXXC5j-GeOaF4GhjpXJGdctorK2fhxZ3qFVU65Y